<title>FINLAND: RESEARCH ALERT - GOLDMAN UPS SAMPO ESTS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GOLDMAN UPS SAMPO ESTS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs analyst Giovanni Govi said on Friday he had raised earnings estimates for Finnish insurer Sampo and maintained a market outperformer recommendation on the stock.</p>
<p>Govi said by telephone from London that his Sampo earnings per share estimates were now 19.2 markka for 1997, 21.1 for 1998 and 23.0 for 1999.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +3589 6805 0247, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
